{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object, move and check its properties. Either drop off, clean or perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDirty    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = CleanObject    /> <Action ID = DropOffObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />",
